<div class="bg-dark-surface border-t border-dark-border h-8 flex items-center justify-between px-4 text-xs">
    <div class="flex items-center space-x-6">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
            <span class="text-dark-text-muted">Status:</span>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1">
                <div class="status-indicator status-online"></div>
                <span class="text-dark-text">Ready</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
            <span class="text-dark-text-muted">Active Workspace:</span>
            <span class="text-dark-text">None</span>
        </div>
    </div>
    @* Was the literal "0.1.0", which had been wrong for months — there was no version property in
       the repo at all, so nothing could have kept it right. Now from Directory.Build.props via
       AppVersion. *@
    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
        <span class="text-dark-text-muted">Version:</span>
        <span class="text-dark-text font-medium" title="Package version @AppVersion.Package">@AppVersion.Display</span>
        @if (AppVersion.ChannelLabel is string channel)
        {
            <span class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-accent-purple/20 text-accent-purple uppercase tracking-wide"
                  title="Pre-release build — expect bugs, and please report them">@channel</span>
        }
    </div>
</div>

